{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 个别地方把人物心理推断得过满，例如 S09 的“甚至愿意再受那些气”，容易把尚未确定的念头说成明确倾向；另外，纵向交替阅读不如 X 左右分栏便于一眼对照。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用加亮短语突出每段叙事的关键转折，感受文字缩小，部分又随音乐进程出现，观众可以先抓住人物在经历什么，再留意音乐如何表现细微变化。它也更清楚地串起了“离开受气—怀念被接纳—害怕孤单—不愿轻易回头—带着想念继续生活”的心理因果与发展，尤其对音乐的节奏、音色、力度和身体感受描写得更具体。X 的左右分栏确实直观，但右侧大量感受词同权并列，容易让观众得到一堆情绪印象，却不容易辨认哪些是关键、哪些对应音乐中的具体变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "79e5735b-4abe-4f86-90af-8fe0c56c8c7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005526632278Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:56:09.897061+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "676fcb17682728b8319fb541cb70f8f52e9da69776aaa6b2552f5c9977a22492", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9